<p>A drone strike that Chadian officials said crossed from Sudan killed 17 people in Chad on Thursday. The attack sharply raised tensions between the neighboring countries.</p><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Border closure: Chad immediately closed its border with Sudan after the strike.</li><li>Military alert: President Deby ordered the armed forces to stay on high alert after the attack.</li><li>Official classification: Chadian authorities said those killed in the strike were civilians.</li><li>Regional spillover: Reports described the strike as the latest deadly sign of Sudan&#x27;s war spilling into Chadian territory.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Chadian government: Authorities said the drone strike came from Sudan, describing it as a cross-border attack on Chadian territory. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c0mjn0g708ro'>BBC News</a>)</li><li>President Idriss Mahamat Deby: Deby warned that Chad would retaliate if the attacks continue, signaling a tougher stance without announcing immediate military action. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c0mjn0g708ro'>BBC News</a>)</li><li>Local residents: Residents cited by reporters said the dead were not combatants but mourners at a funeral and children playing nearby, underscoring the civilian toll. (<a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/19/drone-attack-from-sudan-kills-17-in-chad-as-conflict-spills-over'>Al Jazeera</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/19/drone-attack-from-sudan-kills-17-in-chad-as-conflict-spills-over'>Drone attack from Sudan kills 17 people in Chad as war spills over border</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c0mjn0g708ro'>Chad warns Sudan it will retaliate after drone strike on mourners kills 17</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/chad-says-17-killed-in-sudanese-drone-attack/a-76432675'>Chad says 17 killed in Sudanese drone attack</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/drone-attack-from-sudan-kills-17-in-chad-chadian-government-says'>Drone attack from Sudan kills 17 in Chad, Chadian government says</a> - straitstimes.com</li></ul>